OL,5,G0930 Essential Classics
OL,6,     FGeorgia Mann plays the best in
OL,7,     Fclassical music for your morning,
OL,8,     Fwith discoveries and surprises
OL,9,     Frubbing shoulders with familiar
OL,10,     Ffavourites.
OL,11,G1300 Classical Live
OL,12,     FElizabeth Alker introduces an
OL,13,     Fafternoon of great music-making
OL,14,     Fincluding performances from the
OL,15,     FStaatskapelle Dresden and chamber
OL,16,     Fmusic from across Bavaria.
OL,17,G1500 Choral Evensong
OL,18,     FLive from the Collegiate Church of
OL,19,     FSt Mary, Warwick, with music by
OL,20,     FElgar, Howells, Parry and Vaughan
OL,21,     FWilliams.
