OL,5,G1600 Composer of the Week: The Mighty
OL,6,G     Handful
OL,7,     F3/5. Donald Macleod sees Balakirev
OL,8,     Ftake control over the two leading
OL,9,     Fperforming ensembles in St
OL,10,     FPetersburg.
OL,11,G1700 In Tune
OL,12,     FPianist Clara Rodriguez plays live
OL,13,     Fin studio. Also, conductor Ellie
OL,14,     FSlorach talks to Petroc about her
OL,15,     Fnew album 'In the Witch Trials'
OL,16,     Fout on the Delphian label.
